    "Use existing test frameworks (JUnit 5, Spring Test, Mockito) consistent with the rest of the Spring ecosystem.",
    "Follow existing code patterns, naming conventions, and module structure already used in Spring Cloud Data Flow and Spring Cloud Stream.",
    "For the multiple binder connection factory feature (U8), adopt a composite/factory pattern that supports per-channel/per-destination binder selection while preserving backward compatibility with the single-binder configuration model.",
    "For the container shutdown bug (U7), root-cause analysis is performed against the JDBC source → HDFS sink pipeline, focusing on the stream lifecycle and module shutdown hooks rather than rewriting the modules themselves.",
